---
/**
 * Questions under the video: the class discussion and AI Pitcar Academy, as
 * two tabs of one section. Nothing loads until the section nears the screen
 * or a tab is chosen, so the player stays the first thing on the page.
 */
---

<section class="talk border-t border-body pt-6" aria-labelledby="talk-title" data-talk>
  <h2 id="talk-title" class="g-h3">Tanya dan diskusi</h2>

  <div class="talk-tabs mt-4" role="tablist" aria-labelledby="talk-title">
    <button type="button" role="tab" id="talk-tab-discuss" aria-controls="talk-panel-discuss" aria-selected="true" data-tab="discuss">
      Diskusi kelas <span class="talk-count" data-discuss-count></span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" id="talk-tab-ai" aria-controls="talk-panel-ai" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tab="ai">
      AI Pitcar Academy
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- Discussion -->
  <div role="tabpanel" id="talk-panel-discuss" aria-labelledby="talk-tab-discuss" class="pt-5" data-panel="discuss">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <fieldset class="flex gap-2" data-scope>
        <legend class="sr-only">Tampilkan diskusi</legend>
        <label class="learn-choice talk-chip"><input type="radio" name="talk-scope" value="lesson" checked /><span>Video ini</span></label>
        <label class="learn-choice talk-chip"><input type="radio" name="talk-scope" value="all" /><span>Semua video</span></label>
      </fieldset>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-compose-open>Tulis pertanyaan</button>
    </div>

    <form class="talk-compose mt-5" novalidate data-compose hidden>
      <label for="talk-new" class="text-sm font-semibold">Pertanyaan atau pendapatmu</label>
      <textarea id="talk-new" name="body" maxlength="2000" rows="4" class="learn-input mt-1.5" aria-describedby="talk-rules"></textarea>
      <label class="mt-3 flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-start gap-3 text-sm">
        <input type="checkbox" name="about_lesson" checked class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 cursor-pointer accent-[#cc0000]" />
        <span>Tentang video <strong data-compose-lesson></strong></span>
      </label>
      <p id="talk-rules" class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Dibaca semua siswa kelas ini dan tim Pitcar. Pesan yang menyerang orang, menyinggung SARA, atau berisi promosi akan dihapus tim.</p>
      <p class="learn-error mt-2" role="alert" data-compose-error hidden></p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" data-compose-submit>Kirim</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-compose-cancel>Batal</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <p class="mt-6 text-muted" data-discuss-status aria-live="polite"></p>
    <ol class="talk-threads mt-5" data-threads hidden></ol>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost mt-5 w-full sm:w-auto" data-more hidden>Tampilkan diskusi lainnya</button>
  </div>

  <!-- AI -->
  <div role="tabpanel" id="talk-panel-ai" aria-labelledby="talk-tab-ai" class="pt-5" data-panel="ai" hidden>
    <p class="max-w-prose text-muted" data-ai-intro>Tanya apa saja tentang materi kelas ini. AI Pitcar Academy membaca daftar video dan lampiran PDF kelas ini, lalu menjawab saat itu juga.</p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-ai-suggest></div>

    <ol class="talk-log mt-6" data-ai-log aria-live="polite" hidden></ol>

    <form class="mt-6" novalidate data-ai-form>
      <label for="talk-ai-q" class="text-sm font-semibold">Pertanyaanmu</label>
      <textarea id="talk-ai-q" name="question" maxlength="1500" rows="3" class="learn-input mt-1.5" aria-describedby="talk-ai-note"></textarea>
      <p class="learn-error mt-2" role="alert" data-ai-error hidden></p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" data-ai-submit>Tanya</button>
        <span class="text-sm text-muted" data-ai-left></span>
      </div>
      <p id="talk-ai-note" class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">AI bisa keliru. Untuk pekerjaan yang berisiko seperti rem atau kelistrikan, pastikan bersama mekanik berpengalaman.</p>
    </form>
    <button type="button" class="talk-link mt-2" data-ai-new hidden>Mulai percakapan baru</button>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .talk-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--line));
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .talk-tabs [role='tab'] {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: -1px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: rgb(var(--muted));
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
  }
  .talk-tabs [role='tab']:hover {
    color: rgb(var(--body));
  }
  /* Red marks the selected tab, as it marks a selected chip. */
  .talk-tabs [role='tab'][aria-selected='true'] {
    color: rgb(var(--body));
    border-bottom-color: #cc0000;
  }
  .talk-count {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: rgb(var(--muted));
  }
  .talk-chip > span {
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    padding: 0.375rem 0.875rem;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .talk-threads,
  .talk-log {
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--body));
  }
  .talk-thread,
  .talk-turn {
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--line));
  }
  .talk-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgb(var(--muted));
  }
  .talk-meta strong {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgb(var(--body));
  }
  .talk-team {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgb(var(--body));
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--line));
    padding: 0 0.375rem;
  }
  .talk-body {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 68ch;
    line-height: 1.65;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .talk-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .talk-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgb(var(--muted));
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgb(var(--line));
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 200ms ease, text-decoration-color 200ms ease;
  }
  .talk-link:hover {
    color: rgb(var(--body));
    text-decoration-color: currentColor;
  }
  .talk-link:disabled {
    cursor: not-allowed;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .talk-link--strong {
    color: rgb(var(--body));
  }
  /* Replies sit indented under a hairline, so a thread reads as one conversation. */
  .talk-replies {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 1px solid rgb(var(--line));
  }
  .talk-reply {
    padding: 0.875rem 0;
  }
  .talk-reply + .talk-reply {
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--line));
  }
  .talk-inline {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }
  /* A confirmation inside the action row takes a line of its own. */
  .talk-inline--row {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .talk-inline textarea.learn-input {
    min-height: 5.5rem;
  }
  .talk-who {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgb(var(--muted));
  }
  .talk-answer {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 68ch;
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .talk-answer > * + * {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .talk-answer ol {
    list-style: decimal;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  .talk-answer ul {
    list-style: square;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .talk-answer li + li {
    margin-top: 0.375rem;
  }
  .talk-answer strong {
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .talk-question {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 68ch;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .talk-suggest {
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--line));
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 200ms ease;
  }
  .talk-suggest:hover {
    border-color: rgb(var(--body));
  }
  .talk-suggest:disabled {
    cursor: not-allowed;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  /* The typing mark sits at the end of the last line written so far. */
  .talk-caret:empty::after,
  .talk-caret > :last-child::after,
  .talk-caret > :is(ol, ul):last-child > li:last-child::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.5em;
    height: 1em;
    margin-left: 0.125em;
    vertical-align: -0.125em;
    background: rgb(var(--muted));
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    /* The typing mark sits at the end of the last line written so far. */
  .talk-caret:empty::after,
  .talk-caret > :last-child::after,
  .talk-caret > :is(ol, ul):last-child > li:last-child::after {
      animation: talk-blink 1s steps(2, start) infinite;
    }
  }
  @keyframes talk-blink {
    to {
      visibility: hidden;
    }
  }
</style>
